  "body": "Forcing a reload amplifies the timing signal in cache-based cross-origin leaks (see also http://sirdarckcat.blogspot.com/2019/03/http-cache-cross-site-leaks.html).\r\n\r\nI'm filing this issue to discuss the trade-off. Is a control over the cache a granularity the web platform should have?",
